  "articleBody": "Before approving a curbless shower, confirm the available floor depth, drain location, framing or slab conditions, waterproofing limits, and permit requirements. A qualified remodeling team should explain how the entry will remain level, how water will reach the drain, where waterproofing will extend, and which design choices may increase demolition or construction scope.",
